  "details": "The new FoV setting coming in the new build could break certain camera effects in worlds that expect a fixed FoV for effects that use stacked cameras.\n\nTo enable other cameras in the world to match the base camera, the current FoV setting should be readable by Udon. For bonus points, an event notification when the setting is changed would prevent unneeded extra polling of this value!",
